# Copy to .env.local.
#
# Optional. Without it the app runs fully in its deterministic mode: tokenizing,
# language ID, G2P, syllabification, the rhyme engine, Tier 1 dissection, and
# every detectable device all keep working offline. Only the interpretive layer
# — meaning, entendres, flow prose, and metaphor extraction — is unavailable,
# and it says so explicitly rather than failing (Section 4.4).
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
